           Loading additional Mobile Pages databases
           -----------------------------------------
This file assumes that you have successfully loaded Mobile Pages software
to your Psion.

If you have a need to load additional databases, further information can
be found on the homepage of our Web pages by selecting the  "common ways 
to copy Mobile Pages to your Psion" section.

Alternatively, enter PAGESmgr and press the 'help' key.

In summary, the process is now very simple in that you need to copy a few
files from \app\pages to the same directory on your Psion, and then, within 
PAGESmgr, use the 'Auto install' option, to make them available to 
Mobile Pages.



